     "body": "<p>The testsuite test does not allow for constraints. This is the same as 3.6.1-A.</p>\n\n<p>Either we (Fedora) shouldn't be returning server managed triples by default, should be handling server managed triples leniently by default or the test needs to accept a 409 Conflict with a constrained by header as a valid response.</p>",
